Fix sensor reading and README

- CPU: filter dead (0) AMD SMU temperature readings; show "Sensör Yok"
  instead of a bogus 0.0 C (LibreHardwareMonitor cannot read SMU here)
- GPU: show GPU Core temperature instead of Hot Spot / Memory Junction
- Disk SMART: map the real sensor layout (Level "Life" -> health percent,
  Factor "Power On Hours", Data "Total Space", Composite temperature)
